---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import EmailForm from '../components/EmailForm.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Ironwood — Ironwood Books"
  description="Ironwood gives curious kids strong ideas and useful tools for whatever they grow up to become. It starts with books, written by a father for his son."
>

  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">About Ironwood</span>
      <h1>Why Ironwood exists</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-story">
    <div class="container story-inner">
      <div class="story-text">
        <p class="lead">
          Ironwood is one person: me. I write these books for my son and share
          them with any family that finds them useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started the first one the day I found out he was coming. I kept
          asking myself what I knew that was worth passing on. If I could not
          be there to say it, what would I want written down? That question
          became <em>The Ways of the World</em>, a short guide for teenagers
          about power, money, human nature, and thinking for yourself.
        </p>
        <p>
          The picture books came after. In the Curious Kid stories, the kid asks
          the questions and meets people who have wrestled with big ideas. Each
          book follows one idea from beginning to end.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ironwood is a name used for different trees around the world. Some
          have been used for tool handles, boats, and homes. I liked what the
          name suggests: strong material put to work. That is what I want
          these ideas to be for kids.
        </p>
        <p>
          I cannot know what work my son will do, or what the world will ask of
          him. I can give him ideas and tools he can use wherever life takes
          him, whether he becomes a farmer, a scientist, or something no one
          has named yet. That is the reason for Ironwood.
        </p>
        <p>
          Books are where Ironwood starts. I hope to share these ideas in other
          ways too. Every ebook is free. If you want one on the shelf, the
          paperback is on Amazon.
        </p>
        <p class="story-sig">Evan Paliotta</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="story-aside">
        <div class="brand-card">
          <div class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
              <path d="M16 2C16 2 8 8 8 18C8 23.5 11.5 28 16 28C20.5 28 24 23.5 24 18C24 8 16 2 16 2Z" fill="#2D4A35"/>
              <path d="M16 8C16 8 11 13 11 18C11 21 13.2 24 16 24C18.8 24 21 21 21 18C21 13 16 8 16 8Z" fill="#8B6914" opacity="0.7"/>
              <rect x="15" y="26" width="2" height="4" rx="1" fill="#2D4A35"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Ironwood Books</h3>
          <p>A one-person learning brand.</p>
          <div class="brand-divider"></div>
          <ul class="brand-facts">
            <li><strong>Author:</strong> Evan Paliotta</li>
            <li><strong>Ages:</strong> 4–8 and 14+</li>
            <li><strong>Ebooks:</strong> Always free</li>
            <li><strong>Paperbacks:</strong> On Amazon</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-mission">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="mission-heading">What every book has to pass</h2>
      <div class="mission-grid">
        {[
          { title: "One idea, made clear", text: "Each book follows one idea from start to finish. We tell it as a story, not a lecture." },
          { title: "Useful beyond the page", text: "We look for ideas a child can carry into another part of life, not facts to memorize and forget." },
          { title: "The reader does the building", text: "We show an idea at work. Kids make it their own and decide what to do with it." },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="mission-card">
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-signup">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="signup-inner">
        <EmailForm
          heading="New books are coming."
          subtext="Get the free ebook now. I'll email you when a new title is out."
          variant="banner"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero { background: var(--green); color: var(--white); padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
  .about-hero .section-label { color: rgba(235,241,236,0.7); }
  .about-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); color: var(--white); max-width: 620px; }

  .about-story { padding: var(--section-pad); background: var(--white); }
  .story-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 4rem; align-items: start; }

  .story-text .lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .story-text p { color: var(--ink-mid); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-text .story-sig { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; color: var(--bronze); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }

  .brand-card { background: var(--green); color: var(--cream); border-radius: 10px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .brand-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .brand-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .brand-card > p { color: rgba(245,240,232,0.7); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .brand-divider { height: 1px; background: rgba(245,240,232,0.2); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .brand-facts { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .brand-facts li { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.8); }
  .brand-facts strong { color: var(--cream); }

  .about-mission { background: var(--cream); padding: var(--section-pad); }
  .mission-heading { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .mission-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(260px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 2rem 2.5rem; }
  .mission-card { border-top: 2px solid var(--bronze); padding-top: 1rem; }
  .mission-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--green); }
  .mission-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-mid); line-height: 1.65; }

  .about-signup { background: var(--green-light); padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .signup-inner { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem 3rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .signup-inner { padding: 2rem; }
  }
</style>
